  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside Heavenly Court, Duke Long faces pitch-black needles from Seven Extreme Desolation that carry dark path essence meant to punch through defensive methods. He answers offense with offense: qi currents surge from his breath and form the immortal killer move qi current scissors. Countless white qi currents charge like sharp blades, cutting the needles apart; the two barrages wipe out more than half of each other, and leftover scissors still cut bones and muscle on the Seven Extreme Desolation giant.",
      "chapters": [
        1736
      ],
