    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan and Heavenly Lord Bai Zu drown him in myriad ghost sword dragon and centipede scar, Duke Long again casts qi current scissors. The scissors fly through the swarm, cutting the dragons apart like paper and smashing the centipedes into fragments so he stands clear afterward.",
